Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-homematicccu
Version: 1.0.0
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: madoe21 <https://github.com/madoe21>
Depends: enigma2, ca-certificates
Description: HomematicCCU – Homematic CCU3 device viewer and controller for Enigma2.
 Displays all Homematic devices and system variables on the TV screen.
 Allows changing values directly from the remote: thermostat temperature,
 switches on/off, dimmer levels, roller shutter positions, system variables.
 Requires a Homematic CCU3 in the local network with JSON-RPC API enabled.
